y with many potential hours to be clocked.", "timestamp_created": 1385852830, "timestamp_updated": 1385852896, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7853325", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057513240", "personaname": "Baby Carrots", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/baybeecarrots/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 981, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 496, "last_played": 1513274726, "avatar": "9d306053748d5b5b52641da77ea8dad6ebf0f0f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good", "timestamp_created": 1385852764, "timestamp_updated": 1385852764, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7853152", "author": {"steamid": "76561197980216646", "personaname": "foots", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/76561197980216646/", "num_games_owned": 327, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2186, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1807, "last_played": 1439258400, "avatar": "c63fd958dc02102e9235e86d826916b7d43f4926"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the most entertaining Roguelike-sidescroller-metroidvania I have ever played. Worth the purchase at full price if you can't get it on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1385852046, "timestamp_updated": 1385852046, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "st